# Hosts the fleet driver does not manage (instructor standalone clusters).
# Rebuilt tables would otherwise drop these. Format: <hostname> <upstream-host:port>
#
# Currently empty. admin1/admin2 were torn down 2026-08-24: clusters, IAM roles, and the
# policies they created are all removed, and their routes went with them. A committed
# hostname for a dead upstream serves 502s, and because this repo is PUBLIC it would also
# advertise where an unauthenticated terminal used to answer.
#
# Re-add a line here when an instructor cluster is next provisioned. Its NLB hostname is the
# final line of instructor/up.sh output and is recorded in instructor/states/<name>.lbhost.
